Subject: [qnx-porter 0001] endian-compat
Source: deterministic rule
Reason: <endian.h> does not exist on QNX 8.0. QNX provides BSD byte-order conversion macros in <net/netbyte.h> (__NET_BE*/__NET_LE*); a generated compatibility <endian.h> header in the include search path maps glibc names and byte-order constants to QNX's definitions.
Error: /home/chirag/qnx-porter/ports/can-utils/work/src/mcp251xfd/mcp251xfd-dev-coredump.c:9:10: fatal error: endian.h: No such file or directory
